968+00:00","review_score":70,"scoring_version":"cec-elected-platform-review-v1","scoring_reasons":["Central Election Commission election bulletin","Exact elected candidate and race match","Private OCR candidates awaiting visual transcription review",{"version":"internal-platform-review-ui-v2","decision":"approve","reviewedAt":"2026-08-15T04:46:18.968Z"}],"auto_reviewed_at":"2026-08-15T04:46:18.968+00:00","candidate_id":"4037818a-5bab-4739-b453-649c43114e7a"},{"id":"2ec4390a-c0f6-4963-84a4-22fad9051e0d","claim_key":"cec-platform:2024:votetw-candidate-b7d570ac8843035e","person_id":"689b6c05-476e-4b5f-9df6-8e931d0efa14","source_person_id":null,"claim_type":"platform","claim_value":"繁榮社會：增設社會住宅減輕入住負擔；強化法制保障租屋權益；擴大AI與城市治理帶動生活產業發展；守護勞工權益增進勞動所得。\n自信台灣：強化國防自主實力；平等互惠國際合作；增補臺灣人力裝備。\n多彩高雄：打造立德棒球場成為三級棒球基地；以動物權精神推動友善空間及臨終制度；發展城市擬人化、實境角色扮演等新藝文產業；提升運動設施擴大體育人口。\n安心環境：完善大眾運輸發揮串連效益；加速淨零碳排促進產業升級；精進道路設計提升交通安全；推廣電動共享運具改善空品。\n溫暖生活：深化尊重教育防治暴力霸凌；增設共融遊具打造特色公園；擴大長照設施服務量能；爭取急難弱勢補助相互扶持。","claim_json":{"phase":1,"platformText":"繁榮社會：增設社會住宅減輕入住負擔；強化法制保障租屋權益；擴大AI與城市治理帶動生活產業發展；守護勞工權益增進勞動所得。\n自信台灣：強化國防自主實力；平等互惠國際合作；增補臺灣人力裝備。\n多彩高雄：打造立德棒球場成為三級棒球基地；以動物權精神推動友善空間及臨終制度；發展城市擬人化、實境角色扮演等新藝文產業；提升運動設施擴大體育人口。\n安心環境：完善大眾運輸發揮串連效益；加速淨零碳排促進產業升級；精進道路設計提升交通安全；推廣電動共享運具改善空品。\n溫暖生活：深化尊重教育防治暴力霸凌；增設共融遊具打造特色公園；擴大長照設施服務量能；爭取急難弱勢補助相互扶持。","reviewDecision":{"version":"internal-platform-review-ui-v2","decision":"approve","reviewedAt":"2026-08-15T04:46:19.303Z"},"sourceDocument":{"url":"https://bulletin.cec.gov.tw/01%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E5%85%AC%E5%A0%B1/02%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E5%A7%94%E5%93%A1/113%E5%B9%B4%E7%AC%AC11%E5%B1%86/02%E5%8D%80%E5%9F%9F%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E5%A7%94%E5%93%A1/07%E9%AB%98%E9%9B%84%E5%B8%82/%E7%AC%AC6%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E5%8D%80/%E9%AB%98%E9%9B%84%E5%B8%82%E7%AB%8B%E5%A7%94%E7%AC%AC6%E9%81%B8%E5%8D%80.pdf","file":"tmp/cec-representative-platforms/2024-legislator/pdfs/e8af41652145dfdfd7099df0.pdf","page":1,"sha256":"5f0d157a3a8e4395aeb871147a1ffbefffc41cea77138025cf9d636fcc0a3dee","layoutFile":null,"extractionMethod":"needs_manual_localization"},"electionContext":{"raceId":"acb1ffe8-922c-4202-af59-600f37b4948c","electionId":"1a787d86-d6e8-44b2-b4c4-b9091c9553c8","candidateId":"1deae392-1c0d-4883-9ffd-f0e20a3ac291"},"publicationGate":{"reason":"Election-scoped CEC platform text accepted; minor transcription errors may remain","status":"passed","reviewedAt":"2026-08-15T04:46:19.303Z"},"campaignPlatformReview":{"reason":"Exact person and candidacy were confirmed before publication","status":"passed","reviewedAt":"2026-08-15T04:46:19.303Z"}},"confidence_level":"B","review_status":"verified","visibility":"public","source_name":"中央選舉委員會：2024年選舉公報","source_url":"https://bulletin.cec.gov.tw/01%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E5%85%AC%E5%A0%B1/02%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E5%A7%94%E5%93%A1/113%E5%B9%B4%E7%AC%AC11%E5%B1%86/02%E5%8D%80%E5%9F%9F%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E5%A7%94%E5%93%A1/07%E9%AB%98%E9%9B%84%E5%B8%82/%E7%AC%AC6%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E5%8D%80/%E9%AB%98%E9%9B%84%E5%B8%82%E7%AB%8B%E5%A7%94%E7%AC%AC6%E9%81%B8%E5%8D%80.pdf","observed_at":"2024-01-12T16:00:00+00:00","is_public":true,"created_at":"2026-08-14T15:21:06.590549+00:00","updated_at":"2026-08-15T04:46:19.303+00:00","review_score":60,"scoring_version":"cec-elected-platform-review-v1","scoring_reasons":["Central Election Commission election bulletin","Exact elected candidate and race match","Private source evidence awaiting manual localization",{"version":"internal-platform-review-ui-v2","decision":"approve","reviewedAt":"2026-08-15T04:46:19.303Z"}],"auto_reviewed_at":"2026-08-15T04:46:19.303+00:00","candidate_id":"1deae392-1c0d-4883-9ffd-f0e20a3ac291"},{"id":"be314023-bc20-4745-96ca-e172930acd60","claim_key":"cec-platform:2024:votetw-candidate-b985729f85cad85a","person_id":"3c91d0c0-c4a2-4884-92e3-69f902cf5dc0","source_person_id":null,"claim_type":"platform","claim_value":"岱樺繼續拚四大主軸\n\n1. 能源國安・產業根基\n國艦國造、國機國造、國氣國運，打造高雄海洋國際運籌中心。\n\n2. 智慧科技・農業升級\n擴大農民保險、導入AI科技、冷鏈技術，增加農漁民收入。\n建構科技廊帶，推動中小企業自動化、智慧化，產業升級強化競爭力。\n\n3. 順暢交通・建設繼續\n持續推動捷運林園線、捷運黃線、國道七號、高屏第二快速道路。\n持續爭取全區防洪治水、造橋鋪路經費，保障居民安全。\n\n4. 百年大計・首重教育\n接軌世界、放眼國際，持續推動「校校有外師」雙語教育。\n校園升級、強化教育，持續爭取校園軟硬體建設經費。\n持續媒合產學合作，培養下一代競爭力。\n持續爭取生育津貼、孕婦津貼、托育補助，打造友善育兒環境。\n宜居城市、親子共融，爭取特色公園、共融式遊具。\n擴大推行老幼共園兼顧長照幼教。\n強化動物保護，持續推動友善動物環境。","claim_json":{"phase":1,"platformText":"岱樺繼續拚四大主軸\n\n1. 能源國安・產業根基\n國艦國造、國機國造、國氣國運，打造高雄海洋國際運籌中心。\n\n2. 智慧科技・農業升級\n擴大農民保險、導入AI科技、冷鏈技術，增加農漁民收入。\n建構科技廊帶，推動中小企業自動化、智慧化，產業升級強化競爭力。\n\n3. 順暢交通・建設繼續\n持續推動捷運林園線、捷運黃線、國道七號、高屏第二快速道路。\n持續爭取全區防洪治水、造橋鋪路經費，保障居民安全。\n\n4. 百年大計・首重教育\n接軌世界、放眼國際，持續推動「校校有外師」雙語教育。\n校園升級、強化教育，持續爭取校園軟硬體建設經費。\n持續媒合產學合作，培養下一代競爭力。\n持續爭取生育津貼、孕婦津貼、托育補助，打造友善育兒環境。\n宜居城市、親子共融，爭取特色公園、共融式遊具。\n擴大推行老幼共園兼顧長照幼教。\n強化動物保護，持續推動友善動物環境。","reviewDecision":{"version":"internal-platform-review-ui-v2","decision":"approve","reviewedAt":"2026-08-15T02:23:43.317Z"},"sourceDocument":{"url":"https://bulletin.cec.gov.tw/01%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E5%85%AC%E5%A0%B1/02%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E5%A7%94%E5%93%A1/113%E5%B9%B4%E7%AC%AC11%E5%B1%86/02%E5%8D%80%E5%9F%9F%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E5%A7%94%E5%93%A1/07%E9%AB%98%E9%9B%84%E5%B8%82/%E7%AC%AC4%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E5%8D%80/%E9%AB%98%E9%9B%84%E5%B8%82%E7%AB%8B%E5%A7%94%E7%AC%AC4%E9%81%B8%E5%8D%80.pdf","file":"tmp/cec-representative-platforms/2024-legislator/pdfs/7c41e22b39c231b3763cfc1c.pdf","page":1,"sha256":"9852ac90ade62d47afe519225632306467a2efb83e5e70f7ad65f9f3d0a8ed2a","layoutFile":null,"extractionMethod":"needs_manual_localization"},"electionContext":{"raceId":"4e90c1ba-fed4-4641-b364-04692eb20a97","electionId":"1a787d86-d6e8-44b2-b4c4-b9091c9553c8","candidateId":"1142dfaa-7044-4a80-b0d7-c36a46aaeb4c"},"publicationGate":{"reason":"Election-scoped CEC platform text accepted; minor transcription errors may remain","status":"passed","reviewedAt":"2026-08-15T02:23:43.317Z"},"campaignPlatformReview":{"reason":"Exact person and candidacy were confirmed before publication","status":"passed","reviewedAt":"2026-08-15T02:23:43.317Z"}},"confidence_level":"B","review_status":"verified","visibility":"public","source_name":"中央選舉委員會：2024年選舉公報","source_url":"https://bulletin.cec.gov.tw/01%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E5%85%AC%E5%A0%B1/02%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E5%A7%94%E5%93%A1/113%E5%B9%B4%E7%AC%AC11%E5%B1%86/02%E5%8D%80%E5%9F%9F%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E5%A7%94%E5%93%A1/07%E9%AB%98%E9%9B%84%E5%B8%82/%E7%AC%AC4%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E5%8D%80/%E9%AB%98%E9%9B%84%E5%B8%82%E7%AB%8B%E5%A7%94%E7%AC%AC4%E9%81%B8%E5%8D%80.pdf","observed_at":"2024-01-12T16:00:00+00:00","is_public":true,"created_at":"2026-08-14T15:21:06.560277+00:00","updated_at":"2026-08-15T02:23:43.317+00:00","review_score":60,"scoring_version":"cec-elected-platform-review-v1","scoring_reasons":["Central Election Commission election bulletin","Exact elected candidate and race match","Private source evidence awaiting manual localization",{"version":"internal-platform-review-ui-v2","decision":"approve","reviewedAt":"2026-08-15T02:23:43.317Z"}],"auto_reviewed_at":"2026-08-15T02:23:43.317+00:00","candidate_id":"1142dfaa-7044-4a80-b0d7-c36a46aaeb4c"},{"id":"49bbcc56-c317-4c50-b005-85e276911b9f","claim_key":"cec-platform:2024:votetw-candidate-baeb9d118164713b","person_id":"65326294-d60a-4635-aaad-1f5c16e5aa6f","source_person_id":null,"claim_type":"platform","claim_value":"政見\n\n一、確保主權、接軌世界 : 拒絕一國兩制,捍衛中華民國主權與人民安全,支持與世界民主國家持續合作,追求世界和平。\n\n二、強化教育設施、增加多元資源 : 1. 持續爭取經費,強化學校的教學及學習環境,保障師生權益。2. 爭取各級學校更完善的\n心理健康支持資源,推動非語言形式的諮商運用,使特教生與青少年輔導有更多元的模式。\n\n三、建構完善的交通網絡、促進地方發展 : 1. 持續督促東彰快速道路興建工程盡早完工,提升彰化東半部的交通便利性。2. 強\n化高鐵彰化站對外交通路網提升運輸能量,包含持續推動台鐵田中支線(田中高鐵站 - 田中台鐵站 ),銜接集集支線,提升\n中部地區聯外的便利性,串聯成觀光廊帶,讓田中鎮成為彰化、南投、雲林重要的交通門戶,帶動地方發展。\n\n四、推動地方創生及擴大青年就業:協助爭取中央經費進行地方創生計畫,根據各鄉鎮特色,再造在地產業,從觀光產業、創\n意加值、技術提昇等面向,強化地方產業發展及地方生活機能,吸引青年返鄉。\n\n五、完善長照、優化見福 : 1. 爭取中央經費,協助地方規劃設置各級長照據點,讓長輩受到妥善的照顧、在地老化。2. 敦促政\n府推動各級幼兒照護,提供優質幼兒照顧能量與設施,減輕年輕人生養的負擔,促進人口成長與回流,確保國家永續發展。\n\n六、順應環境、深化觀光 : 1. 保護並善用八卦山脈的生態資源,協助爭取員林市藤山步道生態園區、大村鄉五里坑相思步道等\n計畫,打造優質遊巷環境。2. 積極推動在地的鐵道文伺、花卉產業、生態資源、農村文化,結合地方民俗節慶、馬拉松\n盛會等,推動深度觀光旅遊,帶動彰化觀光產業發展。\n\n七、產業升級、活絡經濟 : 1. 敦促政府強化台灣產業及投資環境,爭取員林新設工業區,吸引企業返鄉投資,促進產業升級,\n擴大就業機會,保障勞工權益,創造勞資雙贏。2. 持續支持發展綠能產業、循環經濟,讓產業能符合國際綠能標準,進軍\n國際市場帶動產業成長。","claim_json":{"phase":1,"platformText":"政見\n\n一、確保主權、接軌世界 : 拒絕一國兩制,捍衛中華民國主權與人民安全,支持與世界民主國家持續合作,追求世界和平。\n\n二、強化教育設施、增加多元資源 : 1. 持續爭取經費,強化學校的教學及學習環境,保障師生權益。2. 爭取各級學校更完善的\n心理健康支持資源,推動非語言形式的諮商運用,使特教生與青少年輔導有更多元的模式。\n\n三、建構完善的交通網絡、促進地方發展 : 1. 持續督促東彰快速道路興建工程盡早完工,提升彰化東半部的交通便利性。2. 強\n化高鐵彰化站對外交通路網提升運輸能量,包含持續推動台鐵田中支線(田中高鐵站 - 田中台鐵站 ),銜接集集支線,提升\n中部地區聯外的便利性,串聯成觀光廊帶,讓田中鎮成為彰化、南投、雲林重要的交通門戶,帶動地方發展。\n\n四、推動地方創生及擴大青年就業:協助爭取中央經費進行地方創生計畫,根據各鄉鎮特色,再造在地產業,從觀光產業、創\n意加值、技術提昇等面向,強化地方產業發展及地方生活機能,吸引青年返鄉。\n\n五、完善長照、優化見福 : 1. 爭取中央經費,協助地方規劃設置各級長照據點,讓長輩受到妥善的照顧、在地老化。2. 敦促政\n府推動各級幼兒照護,提供優質幼兒照顧能量與設施,減輕年輕人生養的負擔,促進人口成長與回流,確保國家永續發展。\n\n六、順應環境、深化觀光 : 1. 保護並善用八卦山脈的生態資源,協助爭取員林市藤山步道生態園區、大村鄉五里坑相思步道等\n計畫,打造優質遊巷環境。2. 積極推動在地的鐵道文伺、花卉產業、生態資源、農村文化,結合地方民俗節慶、馬拉松\n盛會等,推動深度觀光旅遊,帶動彰化觀光產業發展。\n\n七、產業升級、活絡經濟 : 1. 敦促政府強化台灣產業及投資環境,爭取員林新設工業區,吸引企業返鄉投資,促進產業升級,\n擴大就業機會,保障勞工權益,創造勞資雙贏。2. 持續支持發展綠能產業、循環經濟,讓產業能符合國際綠能標準,進軍\n國際市場帶動產業成長。","reviewDecision":{"version":"internal-platform-review-ui-v2","decision":"approve","reviewedAt":"2026-08-15T04:46:19.176Z"},"sourceDocument":{"url":"https://bulletin.cec.gov.tw/01%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E5%85%AC%E5%A0%B1/02%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E5%A7%94%E5%93%A1/113%E5%B9%B4%E7%AC%AC11%E5%B1%86/02%E5%8D%80%E5%9F%9F%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E5%A7%94%E5%93%A1/10%E5%BD%B0%E5%8C%96%E7%B8%A3/%E7%AC%AC4%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E5%8D%80/%E5%BD%B0%E5%8C%96%E7%B8%A3%E7%AB%8B%E5%A7%94%E7%AC%AC4%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E5%8D%80.pdf","file":"tmp/cec-representative-platforms/2024-legislator/pdfs/b9b500c99a90d5691b4969bb.pdf","page":1,"sha256":"8e29fff8e28ba2c661eef945a5a7a70665ae5f19cadb154f46f5798edf88f3d0","cropFile":"tmp/cec-representative-platforms/2024-legislator/crops/1669da07-89f9-4b87-9815-b21af81effe2-8e29fff8e28ba2c6-041a3750f785.png","layoutFile":null,"extractionMethod":"ocr_ready"},"electionContext":{"raceId":"689d1164-8327-4957-9ccf-8991715f2cb5","electionId":"1a787d86-d6e8-44b2-b4c4-b9091c9553c8","candidateId":"1669da07-89f9-4b87-9815-b21af81effe2"},"publicationGate":{"reason":"Election-scoped CEC platform text accepted; mi